        "original_id": "0f8d770e-36e9-513a-b8c4-9ea561e3523b",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: David Draiman, Terry Kath, James Pankow\n- Bands: Disturbed, Device, Chicago\n- Songs: \"Make Me Smile\"\n\nFacts:\n- Terry Kath was born on January 31, 1946, and died on January 23, 1978.\n- David Michael Draiman was born on March 13, 1973, and is an American songwriter.\n- Terry Kath was an American musician and songwriter who was the original guitarist, a lead singer, and a founding member of the rock band Chicago.\n- David Draiman is the vocalist for the bands Disturbed and Device.\n- James Pankow wrote the song \"Make Me Smile\" for the rock band Chicago.\n- Terry Kath performed lead vocals on \"Make Me Smile.\"",
